---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Tentang Tim"
  description="Visi, misi, fokus kegiatan, dan manfaat bergabung dengan Meta Lab Indonesia."
  bodyClass="site-page about-page"
>
<main>
      <section class="inner-hero about-hero">
        <div class="hero-pattern pattern-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-pattern pattern-right" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="research-shell inner-hero-grid">
          <div class="inner-hero-copy">
            <span class="eyebrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i> Tentang Meta Lab</span>
            <h1>Tim Muda,<br /><span>Visi Mendunia</span></h1>
            <p>Kami adalah tim peneliti muda yang berkomitmen menghasilkan publikasi berkualitas dan berdampak global.</p>
            <div class="hero-chips"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Inovatif</span><span><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i> Kolaboratif</span><span><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-asia"></i> Berdampak</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-hero-visual" aria-label="Ilustrasi tim peneliti berkolaborasi di laboratorium">
            <div class="about-scene-halo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="about-scene-orbit orbit-wide" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="about-scene-orbit orbit-tall" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="about-data-panel" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="data-panel-top"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              <div class="data-panel-chart"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
              <span class="data-trend"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up"></i></span>
            </div>

            <div class="about-scientists" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="scientist-person person-left"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-graduate"></i></div>
              <div class="scientist-person person-main"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-doctor"></i></div>
              <div class="scientist-person person-right"><i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i></div>
            </div>

            <div class="about-team-laptop" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="team-laptop-screen"><i class="fa-solid fa-atom"></i></div>
              <div class="team-laptop-base"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="about-book-stack" aria-hidden="true">
              <span>RESEARCH METHODS</span><span>DATA ANALYSIS</span><span>PUBLICATION</span>
            </div>
            <div class="about-microscope" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-microscope"></i></div>
            <div class="about-flasks" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-vial"></i></div>
            <div class="about-idea" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i></div>

            <div class="about-float-card"><i class="fa-solid fa-award"></i><span><strong>Integritas Akademik</strong>Fondasi setiap karya</span></div>
            <span class="about-atom" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-atom"></i></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="visi-misi" class="site-section vision-section">
        <div class="research-shell">
          <div class="site-section-heading compact-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Arah Perjalanan</span><h2>Visi &amp; Misi</h2></div>
          <div class="vision-grid">
            <article class="vision-card">
              <div class="vision-card-copy"><span class="vision-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye"></i></span><div><span class="card-kicker">Masa Depan Kami</span><h3>Visi</h3></div></div>
              <p>Menjadi pusat unggulan riset akademik yang inovatif dan berdampak global bagi kemajuan ilmu pengetahuan.</p>
              <img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/uxpilot-auth.appspot.com/gen_3c0ab527c2_9bbee7c232cc0518.png" alt="Kolaborasi peneliti muda di laboratorium" />
            </article>
            <article class="mission-card">
              <div class="mission-title"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i></span><div><small>Langkah Strategis</small><h3>Misi</h3></div></div>
              <div class="mission-list">
                <div><span><i class="fa-solid fa-earth-asia"></i></span><div><h4>Publikasi Global</h4><p>Mendorong publikasi riset di jurnal internasional bereputasi.</p></div></div>
                <div><span><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i></span><div><h4>Kolaborasi Riset</h4><p>Membina kemitraan strategis dengan institusi akademik dunia.</p></div></div>
                <div><span><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i></span><div><h4>Inovasi Ilmiah</h4><p>Mengembangkan metodologi penelitian yang aplikatif dan mutakhir.</p></div></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="fokus" class="site-section focus-section">
        <div class="research-shell">
          <div class="site-section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Keahlian Terintegrasi</span><h2>Fokus Kegiatan</h2><p>Setiap tahap riset dijalankan dengan standar akademik tinggi untuk menghasilkan publikasi yang berdampak nyata.</p></div>
          <div class="focus-grid">
            <article class="focus-card focus-blue"><span class="focus-number">01</span><div class="focus-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen"></i></div><h3>Penulisan Ilmiah</h3><p>Penyusunan artikel dengan format jurnal internasional yang konsisten.</p><span class="focus-line"></span></article>
            <article class="focus-card focus-cyan"><span class="focus-number">02</span><div class="focus-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i></div><h3>Pengumpulan Data</h3><p>Pengumpulan data dengan metode valid untuk mendukung keakuratan riset.</p><span class="focus-line"></span></article>
            <article class="focus-card focus-green"><span class="focus-number">03</span><div class="focus-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i></div><h3>Analisis Data</h3><p>Analisis statistik untuk menghasilkan interpretasi ilmiah yang kuat.</p><span class="focus-line"></span></article>
            <article class="focus-card focus-purple"><span class="focus-number">04</span><div class="focus-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i></div><h3>Publikasi Jurnal</h3><p>Pendampingan submission ke jurnal internasional dengan pemeriksaan ketat.</p><span class="focus-line"></span></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="manfaat" class="site-section benefits-section">
        <div class="research-shell">
          <div class="site-section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Bertumbuh Bersama</span><h2>Manfaat Bergabung</h2><p>Dukungan komprehensif untuk memperkuat kemampuan riset dan pengembangan karier akademik Anda.</p></div>
          <div class="benefits-grid">
            <article class="modern-benefit benefit-blue"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/uxpilot-auth.appspot.com/gen_6ab7ca2c5c_66b18a9befc049fc.png" alt="Peneliti menyusun artikel ilmiah" /><div class="benefit-copy"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen"></i></span><div><h3>Publikasi SCI/SSCI</h3><p>Kesempatan menulis artikel ilmiah di jurnal internasional.</p></div></div></article>
            <article class="modern-benefit benefit-teal"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/uxpilot-auth.appspot.com/gen_65e87d7705_0d88eaf410e1124b.png" alt="Dosen senior membimbing peneliti muda" /><div class="benefit-copy"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-chalkboard-user"></i></span><div><h3>Mentoring Dosen</h3><p>Bimbingan langsung dari dosen senior untuk metodologi riset.</p></div></div></article>
            <article class="modern-benefit benefit-orange"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/uxpilot-auth.appspot.com/gen_20be68efe5_fc86357f7c27e2f2.png" alt="Kampus modern untuk studi lanjut" /><div class="benefit-copy"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i></span><div><h3>Rekomendasi S2/S3</h3><p>Surat rekomendasi resmi untuk jenjang pendidikan lanjut.</p></div></div></article>
            <article class="modern-benefit benefit-purple"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/uxpilot-auth.appspot.com/gen_408f0f6e89_3c7b318b86830e50.png" alt="Peneliti menampilkan portofolio data" /><div class="benefit-copy"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase"></i></span><div><h3>Portofolio Riset</h3><p>Membangun portofolio kuat untuk karier profesional.</p></div></div></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="values-section">
        <div class="research-shell values-banner">
          <div class="values-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i></div>
          <div class="values-copy"><span>Nilai Utama Tim Riset</span><h2>Integritas, kolaborasi, dan semangat untuk terus belajar.</h2><p>Kami menjaga kualitas akademik sambil menciptakan ruang yang saling mendukung untuk setiap anggota tim.</p></div>
          <div class="values-people" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-graduate"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-user-doctor"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-user-graduate"></i></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
